# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own values.
# NEVER commit the actual .env file -- it's already in .gitignore.
#
# Paper trading runs on thinkorswim paperMoney, which has NO API -- the
# Schwab Trader API that replaced TD Ameritrade's covers live funded
# accounts only and cannot place paperMoney orders (verified 2026-08-03).
# Orders are entered by hand, so no broker credentials are needed here.
#
# Market data (VIX / SPX / ^IRX) comes from Yahoo Finance via yfinance,
# which is unauthenticated. So there is currently nothing to fill in.
#
# If a paid historical options-chain provider is adopted later
# (project_spec.md section 6, step 2), its key belongs here.
# CHAIN_PROVIDER_API_KEY=
